meta {
  name: browser record (download)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/browser-wire
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  The whole browser-record sidecar (~/.spectro/browser-wire) verbatim, as an NDJSON download — every address the agent visited and every script it ran. 404 for a foreign caller, a malformed id or a session that never drove a browser.
  
  Fence: host+origin — Loopback fence plus Origin check: an Origin header, if present, must be loopback. REST clients send no Origin header, which counts as safe — requests pass. A manually added foreign Origin answers a blank 404.
  
  Writes state: no
}
